#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:55
#: acca3b5405ab4ec5a49307248f1ec2e2
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:56
#: cd0c413133824b60b238ebd3265ed03b
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on UART6. It supports all RC protocols except PPM, "
"FPort, and SBUS. See :ref:`Radio Control Systems <common-rc-systems>` for "
"details for a specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` "
"is set to “23”, by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 UART6 上。支持除 PPM、FPort 和 SBUS 以外的所有 RC 协议。详情参见 :ref:`无线控制系统 <common-"
"rc-systems>`。:ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为 「23」 以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:58
#: 9f0aca99508f4538b9e02433d7aa41bc
msgid ""
"FPort requires an external bi-directional inverter and connects to TX 6 with"
" :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` set to \"7\"."
msgstr ""
"FPort 需要外部双向反相器，并连接到 TX 6，同时将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 "
"「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:59
#: 41e8398c7ac34f06a0597ab306a9ce6f
msgid ""
"CRSF requires a TX6 connection, in addition to RX6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 RX6 外还需要连接 TX6，并自动提供数传遥测。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:60
#: 373f2317e13e4ff081730011a5eddb22
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX6 and automatically provides telemetry. Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` set to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接 TX6 并自动提供数传遥测。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:62
#: c7cfb7742e4049099ab7af6d05a6013f
msgid ""
"SBUS can be directly connected to the SBUS pin which ties through an "
"inverter to the RX2 pin.  :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` must be "
"set to \"23\" and :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>`  must be changed"
" to something else than \"23\""
msgstr ""
"SBUS 可直接连接到 SBUS 引脚，通过反相器接至 RX2 引脚。:ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>`"
" 必须设置为 「23」，:ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 必须更改为非 「23」 的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:64
#: d89a0e7ab2d24e21bbb08415114cabc2
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See `Radio Control Systems "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/common-rc-systems.html#common-rc-"
"systems>`_ for details."
msgstr ""
"任意 UART 也可用于 ArduPilot 中的 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 以外的所有协议。详情参见 `无线控制系统 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/common-rc-systems.html#common-rc-"
"systems>`_。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:67
#: db640e7dbf27479cb3ca77e4334065aa
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:68
#: 854a8fc4671a44449d63837f6fcacb8a
msgid ""
"The SpeedyBee F405 AIO supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` =  1 "
"(MAX7456 driver). The defaults are also setup to allow DJI Goggle OSD "
"support on UART3. Both the internal analog OSD and the DisplayPort OSD can "
"be used simultaneously by setting :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` = 5"
msgstr ""
"SpeedyBee F405 AIO 支持使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 1（MAX7456 驱动）启用 "
"OSD。默认设置也支持通过 UART3 使用 DJI 护目镜 OSD。同时启用内部模拟 OSD 和 DisplayPort OSD 可通过设置 "
":ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` = 5 实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:71
#: 1bb981745ace401f898ab654e7841853
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:72
#: 51dc07d2939043faa80361f14178eab9
msgid ""
"The SpeedyBee F405 AIO supports up to 5 PWM outputs. The pads for motor "
"output ESC1 to ESC4 on the above diagram are the first 4 outputs.All 5 "
"outputs support DShot."
msgstr ""
"SpeedyBee F405 AIO 最多支持 5 路 PWM 输出。上图中 ESC1 至 ESC4 对应前 4 路电机输出焊盘。所有 5 路输出均支持"
" DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:74
#: 8b96f7e6a40342879d2c660108108ac4
msgid "The PWM are in 3 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:76
#: d276be0ab8834ece9c991031d0ad0b61
msgid "PWM 1-2: Group 1"
msgstr "PWM 1–2：第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:77
#: ddeddb5136874b43b4033c3f6dcf3b01
msgid "PWM 3-4: Group 2"
msgstr "PWM 3–4：第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:78
#: b36bc9588ae742afa3882e09cb2109e2
msgid "LED: Group 3"
msgstr "LED：第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:80
#: 1a02fdc2fe95445ea272a938dac20695
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. PWM 1-4 support bidirectional dshot."
msgstr ""
"同组内的通道必须使用相同输出频率。若某组内任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。PWM 1–4 支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:85
#: bcb2821281f343faab6bf6c399899bcc
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:86
#: 45df9e1bfb6b4eb3b0dbcdc586082d88
msgid ""
"The board has a builtin voltage sensor. The voltage sensor can handle 2S to "
"6S LiPo batteries. The integrated ESC also provides a current sensor."
msgstr "板载内置电压传感器，支持 2S 至 6S 锂电池。集成 ESC 还提供电流传感器。"

