#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:100
#: 79e3be0358704ca69fa448a5473927b9
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:101
#: 52438ac8ed4f41c59297817cc270f176
msgid ""
"The SpeedyBee F405 AIO does not have a builtin compass but an external "
"compass can be attached using the SDA/SCL pins."
msgstr "SpeedyBee F405 AIO 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA/SCL 引脚连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:104
#: 947880ac84d14f8694a8e4c40c808caa
msgid "Camera Control"
msgstr "相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:105
#: e498fdf32cb14783ba6aac14a3e484c4
msgid ""
"The CC pin is a GPIO (pin 70) and is assigned by default to RELAY2 "
"functionality. This pin can be controlled via GCS or by RC transmitter using"
" the :ref:`Auxiliary Function<common-auxiliary-functions>` feature."
msgstr ""
"CC 引脚为 GPIO（引脚70），默认分配给 RELAY2 功能。可通过 GCS 或遥控器使用 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-"
"auxiliary-functions>` 控制该引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:108
#: 2bc761aad0cc4e649206b34006f62de1
msgid "NeoPixel LED"
msgstr "NeoPixel LED"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:109
#: ade813494e334a078f2b3f8519b529e7
msgid "The board includes a NeoPixel LED pad."
msgstr "板载 NeoPixel LED 焊盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405aio.rst:112
#: 987fb1e925a44a3f960e82a86f52a6bd
